    88	- Lem is always quoted verbatim from the 2013 text with page; paraphrase gets a page too.
    89	  Zylinska's translation choices are noted where they matter (e.g. "intelectronics").
    90	- Every 2026-side factual claim carries `<!-- CHECK: id -->` and a `claims-2026.tsv`
